## The brief
What's On Merthyr Tydfil needed a website that would serve as the go-to resource for local events and activities, keeping the Merthyr community informed and engaged.

## What we built
A clean, easy-to-navigate community website showcasing local events, activities, and things to do across Merthyr Tydfil.

## Results
- Central hub for local events and community activities
- Easy-to-use platform for residents to discover what's happening locally
- Growing presence for the Merthyr Tydfil community online

NC Digital also provided [logo design and brand identity](/logo-design-merthyr-tydfil/) for What's On Merthyr Tydfil, creating a recognisable visual identity for the community platform.

This site runs on our [Managed Starter Website plan for Merthyr Tydfil businesses](/managed-starter-websites-merthyr-tydfil/) — fully managed hosting, updates, and support included.

NC Digital builds websites for businesses and organisations in [Merthyr Tydfil](/web-design-merthyr-tydfil/) and across South Wales.
